### ADG-Bank API Gateway Requests (Port 8080)
@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Actuator Health (Gateway)
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

### 2. User Service - Create User (Alex)
POST {{gateway}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alex_dev",
  "email": "alex@adgbank.com",
  "fullName": "Alex Developer"
}

### 3. User Service - Create User (Elena)
POST {{gateway}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "elena_fin",
  "email": "elena@adgbank.com",
  "fullName": "Elena Finance"
}

### 4. User Service - Get All Users
GET {{gateway}}/api/users

### 5. User Service - Get User by ID
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/1

### 6. Account Service - Open Main Account for Alex (10,000 RUB)
POST {{gateway}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "initialDeposit": 10000.00
}

### 7. Account Service - Open Savings Account for Alex (5,000 RUB)
POST {{gateway}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "initialDeposit": 5000.00
}

### 8. Account Service - Open Account for Elena (1,000 RUB)
POST {{gateway}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "currency": "RUB",
  "initialDeposit": 1000.00
}

### 9. Account Service - Get All Accounts
GET {{gateway}}/api/accounts

### 10. Account Service - Get Accounts for User 1
GET {{gateway}}/api/accounts/user/1

### 11. Transaction Service - Transfer 2,500 RUB from Account 1 to Account 3 (Idempotent)
POST {{gateway}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: adg-tx-0001-guid

{
  "sourceAccountId": 1,
  "targetAccountId": 3,
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "description": "Payment for software consulting"
}

### 12. Transaction Service - Retry with Same Idempotency Key (Demonstrates Idempotency)
POST {{gateway}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: adg-tx-0001-guid

{
  "sourceAccountId": 1,
  "targetAccountId": 3,
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "description": "Payment for software consulting"
}

### 13. Transaction Service - Get All Transactions
GET {{gateway}}/api/transactions

### 14. Transaction Service - Get Transactions for Account 1
GET {{gateway}}/api/transactions/account/1

### 15. Check Balances After Transfer
GET {{gateway}}/api/accounts/1

### 16. Check Balance for Target Account
GET {{gateway}}/api/accounts/3

